  "en": "} Generators, each one costing and producing more<br>\n        than the previous. By default, Generator costs scale by 1.1x per purchase.\n        ${hasUpgrade(6) || player.totalx2.gte(1) || player.totali.gte(1) || player.integrations.gte(1) ?",
