 {
  "en": "} Variables in the game.<br><br>\n        <b>X:</b> x is bought with Points. Its starting cost is 100,000 Points, and its cost is multiplied by 1.1 per purchase.<br>\n        X can be used to purchase X Upgrades, which can be found in the Upgrades tab. These are very helpful for progressing.<br>\n        While there are 4 X Upgrades visible at first, four more are unlocked much later.\n        ${player.y.gte(1) || player.totalx2.gte(1) || player.totali.gte(1) || player.integrations.gte(1) ?",
  "kind": "exact",
  "contexts": [
   "js-other"
  ],
  "sources": [
   "textbook.js"
  ]
 },
 {
  "en": "} Variables in the game.<br><br>\n        <b>X:</b> x is bought with Points. Its starting cost is 100,000 Points, and its cost is multiplied by 1.11 per purchase.<br>\n        X can be used to purchase X Upgrades, which can be found in the Upgrades tab. These are very helpful for progressing.<br>\n        While there are 4 X Upgrades visible at first, four more are unlocked much later.\n        ${player.y.gte(1) || player.totalx2.gte(1) || player.totali.gte(1) || player.integrations.gte(1) ?",
  "kind": "exact",
  "contexts": [
