 },
 {
  "en": "} Z-Colliders, but you can only charge one of them at a time. Charging a Z-Collider<br>\n        allows you to produce Z-Particles of its corresponding type. These Z-Particles can be used to level up each Z-Collider,<br>\n        which allows you to gain milestones that give powerful bonuses and extend previous mechanics.<br><br>\n        <b>Expansion Z-Collider Cost Formula:</b> 2,000 * 8<sup>level</sup> * 2<sup>max(level-15,0)<sup>2</sup></sup>, cost is set to 1e34 at level 19<br>\n        <b>Propulsion Z-Collider Cost Formula:</b> 8,000 * 16<sup>level</sup> * 2<sup>max(level-15,0)<sup>2</sup></sup><br>\n        <b>Inflation Z-Collider Cost Formula:</b> 40,000 * 32<sup>level</sup> * 2<sup>max(level-15,0)<sup>2</sup></sup><br>\n        <b>Reduction Z-Collider Cost Formula:</b> 200,000 * 64<sup>level</sup> * 2<sup>max(level-15,0)<sup>2</sup></sup>\n        ${IntegrationUpgrades.complex9.isBought() ?",
  "kind": "exact",
  "contexts": [
   "js-other"
  ],
  "sources": [
   "textbook.js"
  ]
